This is a maintainer statement about that deployment, not a claim that every
possible defect has been eliminated or that every public branch, modification
or independent deployment has passed the same checks.

Every independent Operator is responsible for its configuration, credentials,
wallets, infrastructure, user funds, security, backups, support, disputes
and compliance with applicable requirements. The original project's operation
does not constitute approval of an independent deployment.

